00:02:12,506 --> 00:02:33,605
跟读：With its cooperation, Mark used a net to drag the seal to the shallow water. Without pausing he helped it out after a simple operation and settled it in a narrow cave by the seaside. Every time he brought it tasty fish, it would yell and suck his hands happily.

11
00:02:33,605 --> 00:02:42,052
听：Witnesses said their anecdotes reflected a magic dimension of the relationship between humans and animals.

12
